рмативный срок службы: 40 лет.","level":3},{"id":"code-20309","kind":"paragraph","label":"20309","text":"20309 — русловые\nНормативный срок службы: 20 лет.","level":3},{"id":"row-233","kind":"paragraph","text":"Скважины артезианские и водозаборные, включая здания и оборудование:","level":3},{"id":"code-20310","kind":"paragraph","label":"20310","text":"20310 — бесфильтровые\nНормативный срок службы: 24 лет.","level":3},{"id":"code-20311","kind":"paragraph","label":"20311","text":"20311 — фильтровые\nНормативный срок службы: 14 лет.","level":3},{"id":"code-20312","kind":"paragraph","label":"20312","text":"20312 — фильтровые, работающие в условиях агрессивной и минерализированной сред\nНормативный срок службы: 8 лет.","level":3}]$batch161_01$::jsonb;
BEGIN
  INSERT INTO asset_classifier_import.resolution_161_nodes (
    ordinal,
    batch_no,
    node,
    source_checksum
  )
  SELECT
    0 + payload.ordinality::integer,
    1,
    payload.node,
    'ac7e28c93b6b3d1f029cec22593157d1624f9de9c7ffee1a811bd60e743b5f4b'
  FROM jsonb_array_elements(v_chunk)
    WITH ORDINALITY AS payload(node, ordinality)
  ON CONFLICT (ordinal) DO NOTHING;

  IF (
    SELECT count(*)
    FROM jsonb_array_elements(v_chunk) WITH ORDINALITY AS expected(node, ordinality)
    WHERE NOT EXISTS (
      SELECT 1
      FROM asset_classifier_import.resolution_161_nodes actual
      WHERE actual.ordinal = 0 + expected.ordinality::integer
        AND actual.batch_no = 1
        AND actual.node = expected.node
        AND actual.source_checksum = 'ac7e28c93b6b3d1f029cec22593157d1624f9de9c7ffee1a811bd60e743b5f4b'
    )
  ) <> 0 OR (
    SELECT count(*)
    FROM asset_classifier_import.resolution_161_nodes
    WHERE ordinal BETWEEN 1 AND 238
  ) <> 238 THEN
    RAISE EXCEPTION 'Resolution 161 import batch 01 read-back failed';
  END IF;
END
$import$;
